# A tiny English dictionary for the tests (the shape of a real Hunspell one): plurals, -ed, -ing, un-.
SET UTF-8
TRY esianrtolcdugmphbyfvkwz
REP 2
REP ie ei
REP ei ie

PFX U Y 1
PFX U 0 un .

SFX S Y 3
SFX S y ies [^aeiou]y
SFX S 0 s [aeiou]y
SFX S 0 s [^y]

SFX D Y 3
SFX D 0 d e
SFX D y ied [^aeiou]y
SFX D 0 ed [^ey]

SFX G Y 2
SFX G e ing e
SFX G 0 ing [^e]
